WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.208
Step 1: Open Sales → Projection &amp; budget to view the source weeks and any missing-history explanation.

2
00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:13.042
Step 2: Normal forecasts average corresponding weekdays from four completed weeks; public holidays are replaced by earlier normal weekdays.

3
00:00:13.042 --> 00:00:22.375
Step 3: For each past day, a complete Weekly report Till + Uber Eats + DoorDash total takes priority; otherwise the saved Daily sales amount is used.

4
00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:28.375
Step 4: Correct missing historical sales and save. Forecasts refresh from the saved inputs.
